NOTICE
======

This tree is the Allwinner Tina SDK U-Boot tree used to build the A733
FES1 loader.  Files keep their original copyright headers, and the two
licences involved are:

GPL-2.0-or-later (full text in COPYING)
  - fes/main/            Allwinner FES1 entry and DRAM training
  - fes/usb/vendor/      Allwinner USB/EFEX stack (see vendor/README)
  - fes/usb/include/ub/  U-Boot 2018 header snapshot (see its README)

BSD-2-Clause-Patent
  - fes/usb/shims/       FES console, exception vectors, MMC backend
  - fes/usb/Makefile

The BSD-licensed shims stay available under BSD-2-Clause-Patent for
reuse in other projects.

The FES1 image also links prebuilt vendor objects that are not built
from this repository:

  - board/a733/libsun60iw2p1_fes.a
  - board/a733/libsun60iw2p1_sdcard.a
  - the DRAM training object dramlib/<platform>/spl_libdram/libdram
    (published by Radxa as allwinner-dramlib, without a licence file)

Those objects carry no separate licence text here, so this repository
does not relicense them and does not describe the linked image as a
whole as GPL.  If you distribute a built image, provide the source for
the GPL/BSD parts above and check the vendor terms for the prebuilt
objects separately.

The host-side flasher and packer live in the edk2-a733 tree and are
BSD-2-Clause-Patent; they are not part of this repository.
